        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "12-1. The Board and the Association agree, inasmuch as supervision and evaluation of teachers is a process in which those concerned are equally involved, that a committee made up of representatives of the principals, assistant principals, supervisors and representatives of the Association will be established to prepare joint recommendations as to policy regulating the supervisory function.",
            "block_bbox": [
                76,
                138,
                515,
                275
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    76.0,
                    138.0
                ],
                [
                    515.0,
                    138.0
                ],
                [
                    515.0,
                    275.0
                ],
                [
                    76.0,
                    275.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "12-2. In cases where a teacher has been given an unsatisfactory rating, the teacher will be given a written statement setting forth the particulars of the unsatisfactory rating.",
            "block_bbox": [
                75,
                284,
                515,
                353
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    75.0,
                    284.0
                ],
                [
                    515.0,
                    284.0
                ],
                [
                    515.0,
                    353.0
                ],
                [
                    75.0,
                    353.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "12-2.1. Where such rating endangers increment or contract status of the teacher for the ensuing year, the teacher must be notified of his status by April 1st.",
            "block_bbox": [
                76,
                362,
                515,
                432
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    76.0,
                    362.0
                ],
                [
                    515.0,
                    362.0
                ],
                [
                    515.0,
                    432.0
                ],
                [
                    76.0,
                    432.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "12-2.2. When an unsatisfactory rating comes after April 30th, the teacher's contract status for the ensuing year cannot be denied except for cause.",
            "block_bbox": [
                76,
                441,
                515,
                495
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    76.0,
                    441.0
                ],
                [
                    515.0,
                    441.0
                ],
                [
                    515.0,
                    495.0
                ],
                [
                    76.0,
                    495.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "12-2.3. Cause will be subject to the provision of the Grievance Procedure.",
            "block_bbox": [
                77,
                507,
                515,
                543
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
